      "vs": "Rengoku",
      "note": "Shinobu's best matchup. Rengoku cannot approach without getting poked by Dance of the Butterfly. Use Compound Eye Hexagon to force him to jump, then Caprice punishes jump-in attempts.",
      "noteJa": "しのぶ最良マッチアップ。煉獄は胡蝶の舞のポークを受けずに接近できない。複眼六角でジャンプを強制し、ゆりかごでジャンプイン試みを罰する。"
