      "vs": "Zenitsu",
      "note": "Hard matchup. Zenitsu's Thunderclap and Flash crosses the entire screen before Dance of the Butterfly can respond. Jump backward immediately when Zenitsu activates Skill 1 — his landing recovery frames allow Dance of the Butterfly punish.",
